  "nextWork": "Prioritize a generic retained top-k continuation that avoids repeatedly sorting and copying the growing retained payload, with explicit vector-shape capability and stable tie semantics. Also avoid serialized-size computation when its legacy limit is absent. Prove scaling and real-fixture runtime effects before claiming a cap."
